  "note": "max_lookahead is the furthest slot the plan may place work in, so look0 is serve-now placement and lookk is k slots of allowed deferral. matched_service_carbon_kg_extrapolated applies the arm's own measured grams per served GPU-hour to run_now's served volume and adds the same idle floor; it is an extrapolation, not a rerun, and is labelled as such so it cannot be read as a measured total. pareto_* is true only when an arm is no worse than run_now on BOTH carbon and missed fraction on the held-out mean. Demand is the one real Azure week for every arm (disclosed)."
}
